            "dots_space": 10,
            "dots_hidden_mobile": false
          }
        },
        "bl_text_8fHPNm": {
          "type": "bl_text",
          "settings": {
            "quote": false,
            "smaller_text": false,
            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "12",
            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Lukáš Klimpera has come a long way on his journey towards a healthy stride. He started his career as a programmer, but after years of intense work he burned out. That’s why he decided to devote himself to a field that has always enticed him.<\/p><p>Lukáš’s greatest inspiration was the teaching of his yoga Master, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vishwaguruji.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">Vishwaguru Paramhans Svámí Mahéšvaránanda<\/a>, at whose prompting he studied <strong>physiotherapy at Charles University<\/strong>, where he met <a href=\"https:\/\/fyzioterapie.utvs.cvut.cz\/document\/show\/id\/249\/\" target=\"_blank\">Clara Lewitová<\/a>. This prominent Czech physiotherapist inspired Lukáš with her vision of <strong>healthy and natural shoes<\/strong>.<\/p><p>After graduation, Lukáš worked at the LOGO clinic in Brno under the supervision of <strong>head physician Kateřina Moráňová<\/strong>. And it was here that he verified Clara Lewitová’s ideas in practice. His clients didn’t just need to exercise. After exercise they needed to put on <strong>shoes that don’t constrict them<\/strong>. And because there was still no brand of healthy and ethical shoes on the Czech market, he decided to create his own. <\/p><p>That’s how Ahinsa shoes were created. Handmade vegan shoes that <strong>respect the shape of your foot<\/strong>. During the first years they gained customers in the Czech Republic and abroad; today people throughout the world are wearing them. Ahinsa shoes are and will remain <strong>comfortable and ethical shoes<\/strong> that will walk millions of steps with you.<\/p><p>For more behind-the-scenes, you can follow Lukáš on his <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/lukasklimpera\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Lukáš Klimpera’s Instagram profile\">Instagram<\/a>.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#202020",
            "hd_color": "#202020",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "Button label",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_link": "_blank",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
            "btn_size": "large",
            "btn_cl": "dark",
            "button_effect": "default"
          }
        }
      },
